      "reviewed": true,
      "translation": "The great Brahman, My Nature, is My womb; in it I place the seed, the conscious principle that causes the expansion of the universe. From that, O Bhārata, arises the birth of all beings. Śrīdhara explains that beings absorbed in Me with the residues of ignorance, desire, and action are joined at creation with their fields of experience.",
